{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02601","headline":"和銮舆顿戏下 · 虞世南","name":"和銮舆顿戏下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重轮依紫极，前耀奉丹霄。\n天经恋宸扆，帝命扈仙镳。\n乘[星]开鹤禁，带月下虹桥。\n银书含晓色，金辂转晨飙。\n雾澈轩营近，尘暗苑城遥。\n莲花分秀蕚，竹箭下惊潮。\n抚己慙龙干，承恩集凤条。\n瑶山盛风乐，抽简荐徒谣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞世南","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02601.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02601","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}